"""MOLE CONTROL DAS - Session Setup Wizard v10.0.12 (Arcade)
File: mole_code_das_2026_01_19_v10_0_12_ARCADE_RELEASE.py

v10.0.12 focus
-------------
This patch adds the operational *Packages Inbox + Indexer* layer so inbound session
packages can be triaged, searched, and ingested without guesswork:

* Package Inbox Index (SQLite): scans a drop folder of session ZIPs and extracts
  metadata (day/session/run/instance/serial/asset tag/site/model).
* Wizard tab: "Packages Inbox" with Scan/Rescan, search filters, and one-click ingest
  into the local sessions root (conflict-safe).
* Supports retrieval of all sessions/runs tied to one asset by searching on
  instance_id / serial / asset_tag.


Housekeeping retained
--------------------
* Date entry UX: dropdown date-pickers (year/month/day) for date fields.
 - Default year range begins at 1900.
 - Max date is capped at 2078-09-16 (per request).

* Site Conditions: elevation fetch (NOAA points endpoint) + OpenStreetMap map link.
* QA/QC: significant digits selector for numeric display formatting (does not change stored values).
* Commissioning: connectivity check tab (gateway reachability + Modbus probe via commissioning tool).

* Hardware Profiles: CRUD + build/update from cfg.hardware map, export channels.json, validate structure, and run per-profile commissioning probe.

Notes
-----
* Arcade logo uses Pillow if available; wizard runs without it.
"""


